<H1 ALIGN=CENTER> Herbs by Season (by Skolte)    </H1>
<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>

<pre>

This is a listing of the herbs that can be found in each season, with how many
herbs on a plant, what environments the herb has been found in, and various
notes on unique qualities it has.  The can be sold to grocers/cannot
and value is rather less than useful now that we have the herb shop, but it
still indicates what are 'pretty good' things to eat. 


Summer:
arnica(3)-Fyjv (cannot be sold to grocers-value 1)
boneset(3)-fFp (cannot be sold to grocers-value 1, cure addiction?, +dex drug)
borage(2)-sb (poisonous)
burdock(3)-f (+10 hps, can be sold to grocers)
cabbage(1)-yfs (can be sold to grocers-value 12)
carrot(2)-yf (cannot-value 1)
cauliflower(1)-yfi (can-value 11)
costmary(3)-pjv (cannot-value 1)
elder(5)-ypv (cannot)
honeysuckle(4)-fp (cannot-value 4)
lettuce(1)-yfsi (can-value 13)
lobelia(3)-yfvh (poisonous, cannot-value -6 [sic])
lungwort( ? )-s# (causes hunger when tainted, always?, cannot-value -20 [sic])
mangrel(3)-d (poisonous, health?, cannot-value -213 [sic])
mystic_carrot(1)-jv (+see all, +cha drug, pick in full moon only)
onion(1)-fyi (cannot)
peartree(6)-fyvi (can)
plumtree(5)-yfphv (can-13)
potato(3)-yfi (can)
rhubarb(3)-yhsi (cannot)
spinach(1)-yfsi (cannot)
strawberry(10)-fpyi (cannot-value 9)
turnip(1)-fysFpi (can)
vine(10)-Ffysine (cannot, inedible, is in druid store, necessary for vine mantle)
water_lily(3)-s (can-24, +2  eps, is in druid store, necessary for reincarnation)

Autumn:
appletree(5)-fyhFi (can be sold to grocers)
barberry(3)-pyFi (addictive, +5hps, can be sold to grocers-value 12)
blood_moss(1)-s (+100sps, +5spr, +10wis, addictive, hallucinagen, +str drug,
86%? duration on the effects?)
chickweed(1)-Ffyspv# (cannot be sold to grocers-value 0)
cotton(8)-yfi (inedible, cannot be sold to grocers-value 0)
hcliz(3)-d (FATAL, cannot be sold to grocers-value -66 [sic], +int drug)
jaslah(2)-d (+75 sps, poisonous, +wis drug)
mistletoe(5)-pjvF (+10 eps, sold in druid store, necessary for replenish energy)
mugwort(2)-s (can be sold to grocers-value 13)
thistle(5)-fs (-10 hps, cannot be sold to grocers-value -20 [sic])
wormwood(3)-vfyF (cannot be sold to grocers)
yarrow(2)-sifv (+20 hps, can be sold to grocers-value 23)

Winter:
chickweed(1)-Ffyspv# (cannot be sold to grocers-value 0)
chicory(1)-fyjF (cannot be sold to grocers-value 1)
comfrey(1)-b (70%-80% plant lore?, +10hps, can be sold to grocers-value 17)
crystalline( ? )-#Stb (+20 sps, is in druid store, used in sneezing powder,
81%?- value 24)
ginseng(1)-fjv (+50 hps, +2 hpr, can be sold to grocers-value 45)
mandrake(1)-s (poisonous, pick at night only, +con drug)
soapwort(1)-sb (cannot be sold to grocers-value 3)
